-    robusta  robusta-runner-6c9995fd89-tcbvg  0/1  Init:ImageInspectError  0             3h32m
-    robusta  robusta-runner-7d55bd7b6d-5r9xl  0/1  Init:Error              4 (117s ago)  3m35s
